---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Kreativ WP"
  description="About KreativWP, an independent WordPress resource and maker of practical WordPress tools."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
  ogTitle="About | Kreativ WP"
  ogDescription="Learn how KreativWP approaches independent WordPress research, practical guides, and useful tools."
  heroEyebrow="About"
  heroTitle="Hi, I’m Andrei."
  heroTagline="I’m Andrei Olaru, the maker behind KreativWP and the wider Kreativ family."
  heroImageSrc="/kreativ-wp-logo-128.svg"
  heroImageAlt="Kreativ WP logo"
  currentPath="/about/"
>
  <section class="card plugin-details" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
    <h2 id="mission-title">A small resource, made with care.</h2>
    <article class="plugin-detail">
      <h3>What I’m building</h3>
      <p>I make focused WordPress maintenance plugins and collect useful theme and plugin research. KreativWP sits alongside Kreativ Font, Kreativ Sound, and Kreativ Tools—not a large anonymous review operation.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="plugin-detail">
      <h3>How I choose what to publish</h3>
      <p>I start with a real job: editing a page, maintaining images, collecting a report, or choosing a smaller stack. Documentation research and hands-on tests have different labels. A test records its environment, versions, checks, and limitations so you can see what it actually establishes.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="plugin-detail">
      <h3>My tools and editorial work</h3>
      <p>I built Kreativ Report Broken Link and Kreativ Broken Image Finder. My products are labelled separately from third-party profiles. Any affiliate link is disclosed; it does not turn a documented profile into an independently tested recommendation.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="launch-cta card" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <h2 id="next-title">Next</h2>
    <p>Explore the editorial library, our products, or get in touch.</p>
    <p><a class="button-like" href="/guides/">Explore guides</a></p>
    <p><a class="detail-link" href="/methodology/">Our methodology</a> · <a class="detail-link" href="/products/">View products</a> · <a class="detail-link" href="/contact/">Contact</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
